###  https://purl.openfaster.org/xsdo/particlePosition
<https://purl.openfaster.org/xsdo/particlePosition> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
                                                    rdfs:domain <https://purl.openfaster.org/xsdo/Particle> ;
                                                    rdfs:range xsd:positiveInteger ;
                                                    rdfs:comment "1-based position within an xsdo:Sequence's particles, in real document order. Meaningless outside a Sequence. Chosen over rdf:List: rdf:List has documented poor SPARQL performance at scale and no native shape-language validation -- see the design doc's Context section."@en ;
                                                    rdfs:label "particle position"@en .


